{
 "version": 1,
 "locale": "en-us",
 "about": "V's English voice-over lines for scripts/v-voice-mods and bridge/v-voice-mods.mjs. lines: the shipped reference's three clips first (pick: true), then spare lines in order of use; probe: FNV-1a 64 hashes of a seeded sample of every plain V line of that gender, to estimate how much of V's voice an archive replaces.",
 "genders": {
  "male": {
   "pool": 18573,
   "lines": [
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq301_m_2a9de24f93453000.wem",
     "stringId": "3070859352337625088",
     "transcript": "Sheesh, in what world did that seem like a good idea?",
     "pick": true
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq017_m_1aaea6c1fb44d000.wem",
     "stringId": "1922657443008270336",
     "transcript": "Nope, don't like the split. Two thirds for me, one for you.",
     "pick": true
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq017_m_1aae98a2d244d000.wem",
     "stringId": "1922641916013629440",
     "transcript": "OK. In I go. Head on a swivel, right?",
     "pick": true
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq024_m_19c2dfcd2e521000.wem",
     "stringId": "1856292068768485376",
     "transcript": "S'not a fan-friendly event, is it?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq032_m_1892b1fa63404000.wem",
     "stringId": "1770673292475121664",
     "transcript": "Makes no sense. Who'd go and do something like this? And why?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq011_m_1900a6ecb04b6000.wem",
     "stringId": "1801623386448420864",
     "transcript": "No, just gotta talk. Heard she's here."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q114_m_19795ea2b02cd000.wem",
     "stringId": "1835602375963627520",
     "transcript": "So, nitrous oxide injection into military hardware?"
    },
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q305_m_2cd4e7650342f000.wem",
     "stringId": "3230461253763919872",
     "transcript": "Can't beat yourself up over this. Reed. Need time, is all."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq019_m_1908ac83734ea000.wem",
     "stringId": "1803881331337109504",
     "transcript": "OK. I'll take care of it. You sleep soundly, now."
    },
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q307_m_2dd68e273f3bc000.wem",
     "stringId": "3302983675938586624",
     "transcript": "Prolly got it right. Just darn hard to believe right this second."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq037_m_199d80b0d33bc000.wem",
     "stringId": "1845772919238279168",
     "transcript": "He told me to tell you that he'll miss you."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q001_m_1be4f6f35a2ef00c.wem",
     "stringId": "2010002858764595212",
     "transcript": "Thanks for the heads-up. Swing by to see you later."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq030_m_1a6c1d0be62fc000.wem",
     "stringId": "1903928679414611968",
     "transcript": "Did you like goin' to this church?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq023_m_19c8eefbf8386000.wem",
     "stringId": "1857997612258975744",
     "transcript": "Gonna tell me you don't think about being a digital psyche? Possible consequences thereof? Really?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q005_m_170ff8c0eb2cd000.wem",
     "stringId": "1661820294985994240",
     "transcript": "Why me? Why do I gotta slot it in?"
    }
   ],
