  "female": {
   "pool": 18416,
   "lines": [
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q306_f_2e4600ff1551400c.wem",
     "stringId": "3334353669688737804",
     "transcript": "Assumin' you guys do save her life, what then? What'll happen to 'er?",
     "pick": true
    },
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q306_f_2c7d0480eb46a000.wem",
     "stringId": "3205723461507260416",
     "transcript": "Would you mind checkin' those flights? Meanin', departure ports?",
     "pick": true
    },
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q306_f_2cdb3ac08e51800c.wem",
     "stringId": "3232241756264300556",
     "transcript": "Nah, no ticket here. Meant to find a cozy nook in the luggage hold.",
     "pick": true
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq006_f_1927b4dc8c2d2000.wem",
     "stringId": "1812616234377486336",
     "transcript": "Know there's a concealed room in your pad?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q112_f_185f156d244e1000.wem",
     "stringId": "1756145938202497024",
     "transcript": "We chatted. Thinks sooner or later the engram'll completely consume me. Process can't be stopped."
    },
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q305_f_2b3888f0c37e1000.wem",
     "stringId": "3114389709980045312",
     "transcript": "Know you'd rather have had her alive."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q114_f_1937fdb3882cd004.wem",
     "stringId": "1817199922192896004",
     "transcript": "Not as much as I'm afraid for you."
    },
    {
     "path": "ep1\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q302_f_2a9a0d03a545a000.wem",
     "stringId": "3069780405315280896",
     "transcript": "Never mind the tech details. Songbird claims she can help."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq012_f_17968125b749d000.wem",
     "stringId": "1699687908367781888",
     "transcript": "Start with your shins. Any idea how much that hurts?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q005_f_17e8f700802cd000.wem",
     "stringId": "1722898438991695872",
     "transcript": "And whadda we do while waitin'? Sit around, suck air?"
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq022_f_18bba22cad4e6000.wem",
     "stringId": "1782196390325018624",
     "transcript": "Somebody likes being the center of attention."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_mq019_f_1afc9fb5884ea000.wem",
     "stringId": "1944604741141962752",
     "transcript": "Dunno. Gonna have to ask him yourself."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_sq032_f_1a71982857386004.wem",
     "stringId": "1905471416383856644",
     "transcript": "I'll do what I need to survive. Even if I have to get my hands dirty."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q004_f_18c0f9f79229f000.wem",
     "stringId": "1783700294143176704",
     "transcript": "'Cause I didn't get in through the front."
    },
    {
     "path": "base\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\v_q112_f_1a7b58105e404000.wem",
     "stringId": "1908215694445527040",
     "transcript": "Had it right. Got an access point to the security systems."
    }
   ],
